  "description": "Need an easy party dip? This make-ahead-friendly taco dip combines a creamy, flavor-packed base with all your favorite taco toppings for a crowd-pleasing appetizer.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Tortilla chips or crudités, for serving\n\nOptional substitutions: plum tomatoes → Roma tomatoes; Hot sauce → taco sauce\n\nNotes: You can substitute all the listed spices and salt with 3 tablespoons of your preferred taco seasoning blend or our homemade taco seasoning.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: The dip can be made through step 2 and refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 5 days.",
